<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Newmont Mining raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Newmont Mining raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it upgraded Newmont Mining Corp to strong buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- said cut Battle Mountain Gold Co to outperform from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
